<article class="card prose">
  <p>Campus Notes is an anonymous notice board for students of HKU, CUHK and HKUST. Only people with a university e-mail address can join, so everyone here is a student or a campus organization. Post a note under a topic, anonymously or with your handle; comment under a per-post alias; like and watch posts; message people privately; and book tickets for campus events.</p>
  <p>Campus Notes is a student project for the course COMP3278 (Introduction to Database Management Systems) at the University of Hong Kong, built by a team of four students in autumn 2026. It is inspired by the Triple Uni mini-program but is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Triple Uni, and it is not an official service of any university.</p>
</article>
